{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 87,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        118.58090209960938,
        27.289522171020508,
        334.9440002441406,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "10. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE OXYGEN USE AND DELIVERY",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.372276306152344,
        274.202880859375,
        72.36227416992188
      ],
      "text": "10.4\t Thresholds for administering oxygen therapy",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.02693176269531,
        399.1427917480469,
        89.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Administering oxygen therapy should be guided by pulse oximetry where available",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        89.02693176269531,
        330.5615234375,
        102.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "and thresholds for giving oxygen vary depending on the altitude.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        104.43158721923828,
        272.92279052734375,
        118.3515853881836
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        120.69618225097656,
        399.0928955078125,
        134.18618774414062
      ],
      "text": "b)\tChildren living at ≤ 2500 m above sea level should receive oxygen therapy if their",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        133.69618225097656,
        308.79150390625,
        147.18618774414062
      ],
      "text": "oxygen saturation is ≤ 90%, as measured by pulse oximetry.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        149.10076904296875,
        272.92279052734375,
        163.02078247070312
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        165.36549377441406,
        399.0827941894531,
        178.85549926757812
      ],
      "text": "c)\t In children living at high altitude (> 2500 m above sea level), the normal oxygen",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        178.36549377441406,
        399.0715026855469,
        191.85549926757812
      ],
      "text": "saturation is lower than those living at sea level. At these altitudes, a lower level of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        191.36549377441406,
        388.9635925292969,
        204.85549926757812
      ],
      "text": "saturation, such as SpO  ≤ 87%, could be used as a threshold for giving oxygen.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        162.8636932373047,
        198.65150451660156,
        165.7436981201172,
        206.74551391601562
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        206.77008056640625,
        248.602783203125,
        220.69009399414062
      ],
      "text": "(Recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        223.03480529785156,
        399.12286376953125,
        236.52481079101562
      ],
      "text": "The panel strongly recommended that children with oxygen saturation < 90%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        236.03480529785156,
        394.0229187011719,
        249.52481079101562
      ],
      "text": "should be administered oxygen therapy. At high altitudes, a lower level of SpO",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        393.97039794921875,
        243.32078552246094,
        398.21240234375,
        251.414794921875
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        249.03480529785156,
        399.0730285644531,
        262.5248107910156
      ],
      "text": "was recommended because of resource implications by consensus. However, this",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        262.0347900390625,
        399.06292724609375,
        275.5248107910156
      ],
      "text": "recommendation excludes oxygen therapy in preterm neonates, where care needs to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        275.0347900390625,
        260.4929504394531,
        288.5248107910156
      ],
      "text": "be taken to avoid hyperoxia-related complications.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        299.55340576171875,
        231.48292541503906,
        311.54339599609375
      ],
      "text": "10.4.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.2079772949219,
        399.12298583984375,
        328.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review [Subhi, 2010] could not identify any studies that have compared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.2079772949219,
        399.0028076171875,
        341.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "outcomes of children receiving oxygen at different thresholds. The evidence base for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.2079772949219,
        399.0979309082031,
        354.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "the cut-off of SpO  indicating the need for oxygen is weak. The normal saturation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        131.44790649414062,
        348.4940185546875,
        134.32791137695312,
        356.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.2079772949219,
        399.1128234863281,
        367.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "drops with increasing altitude. A threshold of 90–94% at sea level and 85–87% at high",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.2079772949219,
        334.13275146484375,
        380.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "altitudes has been used in clinical studies, and is reported to be safe.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        380.2079772949219,
        399.0414733886719,
        393.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "One observational study at high altitude shows increasing risk of death with lower",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.2079772949219,
        399.11669921875,
        406.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "saturations at admission, and mortality benefit using SpO  < 85% as threshold for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        296.8367919921875,
        400.4940185546875,
        299.716796875,
        408.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.2079772949219,
        399.0528564453125,
        419.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "giving oxygen [Duke, 2001]. At sea level, there is a physiological argument to maintain",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.2080078125,
        399.0228576660156,
        432.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "oxygen saturation above 90%, because the sigmoidal shape of the oxygen dissociation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.2080078125,
        399.11297607421875,
        445.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "curve means that for saturations below this a small drop in SaO  corresponds to a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322.4330139160156,
        439.4940185546875,
        325.3130187988281,
        447.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.2080078125,
        399.0637512207031,
        458.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "large drop of PaO . Studies of normal saturation in healthy children at sea level show",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.8021011352539,
        452.4940185546875,
        130.68209838867188,
        460.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.2080078125,
        394.0232849121094,
        471.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "that normal SpO  ranges from 97–100% in this population. However, using any SpO",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.39320373535156,
        465.4940185546875,
        396.85040283203125,
        473.5880126953125
      ],
      "text": "2 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.2080078125,
        399.07281494140625,
        484.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "below this range to indicate the need for oxygen would result in over-treatment of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.2080078125,
        399.082763671875,
        497.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "healthy children. Anecdotally, thresholds between 90–94% have been used in clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        497.2080078125,
        189.92294311523438,
        510.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "practice and studies for decades.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        510.2080078125,
        399.0514831542969,
        523.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "Normal oxygen saturation drops with altitude. Figure 1 shows at an altitude of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.2080078125,
        399.0494689941406,
        536.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "2500 m above sea level, SpO  of 90% is within the normal range. Therefore, at high",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.3094940185547,
        530.4939575195312,
        175.1894989013672,
        538.5879516601562
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.2080078125,
        399.05389404296875,
        549.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "altitude, a lower level of SpO  defines hypoxaemia than at sea level, and using a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        179.8040008544922,
        543.4939575195312,
        182.6840057373047,
        551.5879516601562
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        549.2080078125,
        399.08282470703125,
        562.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "universal threshold would therefore result in over-treatment of children residing in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.2080078125,
        399.0928649902344,
        575.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "these settings. The potential drawbacks of over-treating non-hypoxaemic children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.2080078125,
        399.1329650878906,
        588.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "with oxygen are increased rates of hospitalization, increase lengths of stay in hospital,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        588.2080078125,
        399.0928955078125,
        601.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "and parental anxiety. Previous studies at high altitude have used definitions ranging",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.2080078125,
        399.111083984375,
        614.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "from SpO  85–87% to account for the effect of altitude, and have not reported any",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.31109619140625,
        608.4939575195312,
        100.19109344482422,
        616.5879516601562
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        614.2080078125,
        202.7829132080078,
        627.697998046875
      ],
      "text": "adverse outcomes as a result of this.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.43130493164062,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.6123046875,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "73",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}